From e1b793697f39407714d966a1b9c776ff52c8e07f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:43:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] design: check out the compiled tokens with LF on every
 platform

The up-to-date test compares css/tokens.css byte for byte with what the
build writes (LF); a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf got CRLF and
failed on an unchanged file.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011CH6tKeE4iJ874reAvf4rR
---
 packages/design/.gitattributes | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 packages/design/.gitattributes

diff --git a/packages/design/.gitattributes b/packages/design/.gitattributes
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..7950c14
--- /dev/null
+++ b/packages/design/.gitattributes
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# The compiled tokens are compared byte for byte with what the build writes, and the build writes LF. Without this,
+# a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf) gets CRLF and the package's up-to-date test fails on an unchanged file.
+css/tokens.css text eol=lf
-- 
2.43.0

